.TH ZERODDS-COAP-BRIDGED 1 "" "ZeroDDS" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-coap-bridged \- DDS to CoAP bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-coap-bridged
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-bind\fR \fIADDR\fR]
[\fB\-\-domain\fR \fIID\fR]
[\fB\-\-topic\fR \fIDDS:URI\fR]...
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-coap-bridged
exposes DDS topics as CoAP resources (RFC 7252) over UDP and DTLS, with
support for CoAP-Block (RFC 7959) and Observe (RFC 7641). Maps GET to
take_next_sample, PUT/POST to write, OBSERVE to a long-lived reader.
Implements
.IR docs/specs/zerodds-coap-bridge-1.0.md .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-config =\fIFILE\fR
Path to the config file (YAML). See
.BR zerodds-coap-bridged.yaml (5).
.TP
.BR \-\-bind =\fIADDR\fR
UDP bind address. Default:
.IR 0.0.0.0:5683 .
.TP
.BR \-\-domain =\fIID\fR
DDS domain ID. Default: 0.
.TP
.BR \-\-dtls\-psk\-id =\fIID\fR
DTLS PSK identity; enables
.IR coaps:// .
.TP
.BR \-\-dtls\-psk =\fISECRET\fR
DTLS PSK secret, hex; enables
.IR coaps:// .
.TP
.BR \-\-dtls\-cert =\fIFILE\fR
DTLS server cert, PEM; enables
.IR coaps:// .
.TP
.BR \-\-dtls\-key =\fIFILE\fR
DTLS server key, PKCS#8 PEM.
.TP
.BR \-\-topic =\fIDDS:URI\fR
Topic override (repeatable).
.TP
.BR \-\-log\-level =\fILEVEL\fR
One of
.IR trace ", " debug ", " info ", " warn ", " error .
.TP
.BR \-\-metrics =\fIADDR\fR
Prometheus listener.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Version info.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the option synopsis.
.TP
.BR \-\-set " \fIPATH\fR=\fIVALUE\fR"
One setting above every file, repeatable;
.BI + PATH = VALUE
appends to a list.
.TP
.B \-\-check\-config
Validate and print the effective configuration with the origin of every
value, then exit: 0 valid, 1 invalid value or unknown key, 2 unreadable
file, syntax error or include cycle.
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM stops the daemon.
SIGHUP reads the configuration again: the topic ACL and the auth settings
apply from then on, the DTLS material to new handshakes. Changed topics,
binds or domain need a restart and are logged. A configuration that does
not load changes nothing.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT
Optional OTLP endpoint, such as http://localhost:4318.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal shutdown.
.TP
.B 1
Configuration error.
.TP
.B 2
Bind error \(em address in use.
.TP
.B 3
DDS discovery error.
.TP
.B 4
DTLS or OSCORE setup error.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/zerodds/coap-bridged.yaml .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-coap-bridged.yaml (5),
RFC 7252, RFC 7641.
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
